{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25151","headline":"题汉州西湖 · 严公贶","name":"题汉州西湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤沼才难尽，余思凿西湖。\n珍木罗修岸，冰光映坐隅。\n琴台今寂寞，竹岛尚萦纡。\n犹蕴济川志，芳名终不渝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严公贶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25151.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25151","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}